Hi Vanessa,

The Applied Document Research Forum is inviting Methods Abstracts. The deadli=
ne is February 14 at 5:00 p.m. Pacific. I've attached the program committee's=
 submission guide with the field requirements.

A study need not have final results to be considered: an abstract can explain=
 the procedure while a comparison is still pending. Please make the stage of =
the work clear so that readers can distinguish completed work from the planne=
d method.

I thought your work on short intake text might be a good fit. Please let me k=
now if the form raises any questions.

Best,
Charlotte


